WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:02.070
I am in Morocco!

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:07.359
Well, not really. I'm actually in Disney's
version of Morocco, in EPCOT --

00:00:07.359 --> 00:00:13.500
-- which is why this particular back street
has an emergency exit.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.160
And here is something you might not know,
and it's about...

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:17.779
ice cream.

00:00:17.779 --> 00:00:23.439
See, I'm in America. And in America, this
ice cream has to contain milk.

00:00:23.439 --> 00:00:26.220
Actual milk. Specifically, a certain percentage
of milk fat.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:29.939
But if I were in Britain, that's not necessarily
the case.

00:00:29.939 --> 00:00:33.270
You see, British ice cream, unless it has
the phrase "dairy" on it,

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:39.730
can actually be made of something called "bleached
deodorised, hydrogenated vegetable oil".

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:41.829
Which means that the stuff you get out of
ice cream vans

00:00:41.829 --> 00:00:45.260
and the cheap stuff you get in supermarkets

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.610
might not have any milk in it at all.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:49.520
This, on the other hand, is American ice cream,

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:52.359
which means I can be certain -- or at least
reasonably certain --

00:00:52.359 --> 00:00:53.590
that it's made with milk.

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:55.880
And that's something you might not have known.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.720
[Translating these subtitles? Add your name here!]

